# Edition 1 = 115年地方公職人員選舉 (2026-11-28); later elections are added as new versions under the same concept DOI.
abstract: >-
  Raw open data on events held in Taiwan on Saturday 28 November 2026, the polling day of Taiwan's local elections and a
  national referendum: the 16 events listed by ticketing and official pages, every organiser, co-organiser, producer and
  sponsor credit as printed, and the credited companies' registry records (equity status, capital, directors, supervisors and
  holdings) from Taiwan's Ministry of Economic Affairs company registry. Also included: raw event listings and dated news reports
  for national polling days since 2016 and nearby Saturdays, and political-donation register extracts for the credited companies'
  groups (no party labels). The release contains no analysis, classification or conclusions. Pre-publication data release.
keywords:
  - Taiwan
  - elections
  - concerts
  - live music industry
  - company registry
  - open data
  - 九合一
  - 投票日
